--- meta
title: Your [PRODUCT_NAME] password was changed
aria: Your [PRODUCT_NAME] password was changed
preheader: No action is needed if this was you. If not, secure your account now.
subject: Your [PRODUCT_NAME] password was changed
footer: transactional
reason: You are receiving this email because the password for the [PRODUCT_NAME] account registered to [EMAIL_ADDRESS] was changed.
