--- text
Your password was changed

The password for your [PRODUCT_NAME] account was changed at
[EVENT_TIME]. If you made this change, no action is needed and you
can ignore this message.

Details of the change

Account: [EMAIL_ADDRESS]
When: [EVENT_TIME]
Where: [EVENT_LOCATION]

Important: If you did not make this change, your account may be at
risk. Secure your account now, and change the password anywhere
else you used the same one.

Secure your account:

[SECONDARY_URL]

We will never ask you for your password by email. If anything here
looks wrong, reply to this email, or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A
real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
